# .aikit-ignore — Global rule suppressions for AI Dev Kit
# Copy this file to .aikit-ignore at your project root.
# One rule ID per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# These rules will be suppressed on every file write project-wide.
# For per-file suppression, use: // ai-kit:ignore <RULE-ID> in the source file.

# Example: allow console.log if your project uses a custom logger wrapper
# F-001

# Example: TODOs are tracked in your issue tracker, not blocking
# U-002

# Example: project uses a shared scheduler bean with @Async configured globally
# J-008
